      "content": "resilience?? how can i be resilient when there is nothing left to fight for? the walls are crumbling and everyone i care about is already gone or dying. it feels like there is no way out of this except for what happens when they finally break through. i just don't want to be there when they do. i don't want to see what they do to us.",
