    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "memories dont stop the fear. they just make the fear hurt more. it feels like the only thing i actually have control over is how this ends. if i'm just sitting here waiting to be taken, i'm just a victim. i don't want to be a victim. i want to have some dignity left, even if it's just a little bit.",
